# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Run messages-parity-group2-setup.walk on a fresh DEMO first; Ana is pinned/muted.
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
expect Messages
hold Ana Demo
expect Unpin
expect Unmute
shot current-chat-actions card=messages-parity-chat-actions
tap Cancel
expect Pinned
expect Muted
shot current-pinned-muted card=messages-parity-pinned-muted
tap Ana Demo
absent Messages
doubletap Perfect, see you there
expect Tapback like
shot current-reaction-menu card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
tap Tapback like
# His own chip takes it off with a tap (no list since 0.8.14); someone else's does nothing.
expect Remove your reaction, like
tap Remove your reaction, like
absent People who reacted
absent Remove your reaction, like
tap Reaction on: Yes! 7pm
absent People who reacted
expect Reaction on: Yes! 7pm
# A raw drag cannot navigate the underlying chat while a reaction menu is open.
doubletap Perfect, see you there
expect Tapback like
key BACK
expect Perfect, see you there
absent Tapback like
key BACK
tap Sideways
doubletap Photo
expect Tapback like
shot photo-reactions card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
key BACK
swipefrom Photo 0.3 0 550
expect Replying
shot photo-reply card=messages-parity-gesture-reply
tap "Don't reply to this"
key BACK
tap Clips
doubletap Video, tap to play
expect Tapback like
shot video-reactions
key BACK
key BACK
tap Voices
doubletap Voice message
expect Tapback like
shot voice-reactions
key BACK
key BACK
